<title>UK: Westhyp sets 250 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Westhyp sets 250 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Norddeutsche Landesbank GZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFAELISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY    09.MAY.03</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.83    PAY DATE    09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR YEARS 1 AND 2, 5.0 PCT FOR YEARS 3 AND 4, 6.0</p>
<p>		PCT YEAR 5 AND 7.0 PCT FOR YEAR 6</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
